  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM: Response to vulnerable migrants on the Eastern Corridor - IOM: response to vulnerable migrants on the Eastern Corridor-Regional</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM: Svar till utsatta migranter i &#xF6;stra korridoren</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM, through a humanitarian and development focused support, has the following four strategic objectives which are aligned to the overall goals of the Regional Migrant Response Plan (MRP) for the Horn of Africa and Yemen:

1. Provide life-saving assistance to migrants in vulnerable situations and host communities along the Eastern Route.

2. Provide quality, timely, comprehensive, and inclusive protection services to migrants in vulnerable situations and host communities.

3. Strengthen access to return, sustainable reintegration, and community stabilization.

4. Building evidence, partnerships, and coordination to enhance the humanitarian response and migration management throughout the migration route.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Along the eastern route, migrants face several life-threatening risks. The program aims to provide humanitarian and lifesaving assistance to vulnerable migrants in transit countries and facilitate the voluntary return of vulnerable migrants that include women and girls, victims of trafficking, victims of violence, and people with disabilities. Furthermore, the program aims to find durable solutions for migrant through the provision of tailored individual reintegration assistance to returnees and the legalization of migrants in host countries. The intervention will also support community stabilization projects targeting both communities of origin and transit. In country of origin, community stabilization project will focus on creating employment and livelihood opportunities in communities affected by climate change, reaching a larger number of beneficiaries, and complementing the individual reintegration assistance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L&#xE4;ngs den &#xF6;stra rutten s&#xE5; st&#xE4;lls migranter inf&#xF6;r flera livshotande risker. Programmet syftar till att tillhandah&#xE5;lla humanit&#xE4;r och livr&#xE4;ddande hj&#xE4;lp till utsatta migranter i transitl&#xE4;nder och att underl&#xE4;tta ett frivilligt &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndande av utsatta migranter vilket inkluderar kvinnor och flickor, offer f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nniskohandel, v&#xE5;ldsoffer och personer med funktionshinder. Programmet syftar dessutom till att identifiera h&#xE5;llbara l&#xF6;sningar f&#xF6;r migranter genom att tillhandah&#xE5;lla individuellt skr&#xE4;ddarsydd &#xE5;teranpassningshj&#xE4;lp f&#xF6;r &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndande och att legalisera migranterna i v&#xE4;rdl&#xE4;nderna. Insatsen kommer &#xE4;ven att st&#xF6;dja gemensamma stabiliseringsprojekt inriktade p&#xE5; b&#xE5;de ursprungs- och transitsamh&#xE4;llen. I ursprungslandet s&#xE5; kommer gemensamma stabiliseringsprojekt att fokusera p&#xE5; att skapa syssels&#xE4;ttnings- och f&#xF6;rs&#xF6;rjningsm&#xF6;jligheter i samh&#xE4;llen drabbade av klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringar, att n&#xE5; ett st&#xF6;rre antal f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;nstagare och att komplettera det individuella &#xE5;teranpassningsst&#xF6;det.</narrative>
  </description>
